<!-- ===== 11. FORENSIC INTERVIEWING ===== -->
<section class="sec sec--soft" id="forensic">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="fi">
      <div class="fi-copy rv">
        <p class="eyebrow is-brand">Forensic Interviewing</p>
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.1vw,40px)">Interviews Reveal More When You Know Where to Look.</h2>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href={url("/find-talent/#evaluation")}>Explore Our Interviewing Approach</a>
      </div>
      <div class="fi-lines rv" style="--d:1">
        <p class="lede">A polished interview does not necessarily reveal how someone will lead, communicate, solve problems, respond under pressure, or work with the people around them.</p>
        <p class="lede">HSG brings decades of recruiting, HR, assessment, and interviewing experience into the process to help clients look beyond rehearsed answers. We work to uncover the experiences, behaviors, motivations, inconsistencies, strengths, and working styles that can influence whether a candidate succeeds after the interview is over.</p>
        <p class="fi-brandline"><span>Better Questions.</span><span>Deeper Listening.</span><span>Better Decisions.</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

